WEBVTT

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:03.136
Know that there are millions of us.

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:05.456
Come out of the shadows.

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:06.696
Cut back,

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:08.056
small up;

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:10.480
think strategy, not failure;

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:13.136
get off your throne

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:17.800
and find the bridgework
to get your through the lean times.

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:22.296
As a country, we have achieved longevity,

00:16:22.320 --> 00:16:27.536
investing billions of dollars
in the diagnosis, treatment

00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:29.320
and management of disease.

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:34.136
It's not enough to just live a long time.